# AI Agent Rules

AI is part of the MVP but must be controlled by credits and logs.

Rules:
- Every AI operation must create ai_requests.
- Every AI operation must record ai_usage_logs.
- Check ai_credit_wallets before processing.
- If credits are insufficient, return LIMIT_REACHED.
- AI material search uses project_required_components.
- AI results are stored in ai_material_matches.
- Match types are:
  EXACT
  SIMILAR
  ALTERNATIVE
  MISSING
- Do not implement YouTube video analysis in MVP.
- Do not build unlimited AI chat memory.